      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks that's a good start but i think the \"embracing the future residents\" part might be a bit too soft for what the crowd is feeling. they're worried that the rapid influx of new cultures and people is actually washing away the character of the town entirely. can you rewrite it to focus more on the urgency of protecting our specific traditions before they get lost or diluted? make it sound like we're at a turning point where we have to choose between our identity and losing it.",
